  - elementId: r1-b
    elementType: text
    bounds: [376, 144, 536, 64]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>grok-code-fast-1</strong>：SWE-Bench Verified 70.8%，API 仅 $0.20/$1.50 每百万；<strong>Grok 4.5</strong> Terminal-Bench 83.3%，定位接近 Opus 但价格是零头；Grok 4 Heavy 多 Agent、AIME 近满分。订阅不含 API 额度。</p>
