    bounds: [376, 328, 536, 15]
    content: {style: "$h2", wrap: false, align: [left, middle], text: 生态闭环与适合场景}
  - elementId: r3-b
    elementType: text
    bounds: [376, 348, 536, 84]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>闭环 <span style="color:$accent"><strong>★★★★☆</strong></span>：Grok Build 只跑自家模型且必须订阅；但呈「联盟式闭环」——Heavy 送 Cursor Ultra，grok-code-fast-1 反向铺进 Copilot / Cursor / opencode 抢份额。适合追求极致性价比的终端流重度用户。</p>
  - elementId: note-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 446, 4, 42]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
